flowchart TD
    A[User question] --> B[Embed question]
    B --> C[Retrieve top-k chunks from Qdrant]
    C --> D{Any chunks and best score above threshold?}
    D -- No --> E[Return fallback without calling LLM]
    D -- Yes --> F[Build context prompt]
    F --> G[Call LLM]
    G --> H[Grounded answer]
